# Text tour of AI Mini Drama for the language passes (rule 7; TC-275–277): every reachable page, sheet and dialog
# that costs nothing, with `texts $1-<screen>` (screenshot + visible strings) on each.
# Starts: the Launcher (app already launched in the language, e.g. `launch --lang ja`). Ends: the Launcher.
# Charges nothing: no Generate, no Send; template chat left before its outline (not saved); Choose Character left
# without picks; Rename/Delete never confirmed.
# Needs History items 「綴じられた秘密」 (storyboard + video card) and 「The Gambit」 (characters done; P9-e variant 2026-10-23).
# Uses ids throughout (labels change with the language); coordinates only for the History item ⋯ (2nd row) and its
# Rename row / Rename dialog Cancel, the
# Daniel slot, the Create my character tile, the 2nd library card's Enlarge, the system Alert's first button and the
# 3rd template card on the entry page (After Closing).
# Args: $1 = file prefix, e.g. TC-276
# Written 2026-10-21 (P23-f) from the TC-275 English walk.
?tapif launcher.UIButton.homeButton
drag 210 300 210 800 300
id launcher.collectionViewCell.pdrm_launcher_AI_create_AI_Mini_Drama
waitfor aiMiniDramaEntry.UIButton.createDrama --timeout 20
texts $1-entry
# Template list (3 screens), then the After Closing card, Make my version, format card, leave (not saved)
id aiMiniDramaEntry.UIButton.moreTemplates
wait 2
texts $1-templates
drag 210 750 210 200 400
drag 210 750 210 200 400
texts $1-templates-2
drag 210 750 210 200 400
texts $1-templates-3
id aiMiniDramaTemplateList.UIButton.back
wait 1
tap 340 480
wait 3
texts $1-template-card
id aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.UIButton.makeMyVersion
waitfor aiMiniDramaFormat.UIButton.continue --timeout 60
texts $1-format-card
id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.back
wait 2
texts $1-leave-chat-dialog
?id alertController.UIButton.button
wait 2
# History: list, info tip, Manage, ⋯ menu, Rename dialog (Cancel)
id aiMiniDramaTemplatePreview.UIButton.history
wait 3
texts $1-history
id aiMiniDramaHistory.UIButton.info
wait 2
texts $1-history-info
tap 210 160
wait 1
id aiMiniDramaHistory.UIButton.manage
wait 2
texts $1-history-manage
id aiMiniDramaHistory.UIButton.cancel
wait 1
tap 377 306
wait 2
texts $1-history-more
tap 91 794
wait 2
texts $1-rename
tap 142 391
wait 1
# Storm and Shelter chat: characters + storyboard card, credit page, Choose Character, filter, Create my character
lbl The Gambit
wait 4
?lbl ic arrow down
wait 2
texts $1-chat-storm
id aiMiniDramaOutline.ThemeCreditEntryView.creditEntry
wait 3
texts $1-credits
id creditsHomePage.UIButton.backButton
wait 2
id aiMiniDramaCast.UIButton.refresh.char_9a8f66aa
wait 3
texts $1-choose-character
id aiMiniDramaChangeCharacters.UIButton.filter
wait 2
texts $1-filter
drag 380 715 60 715 400
wait 1
texts $1-filter-2
id aiMiniDramaCharacterFilter.UIButton.apply
wait 2
tap 79 395
wait 3
texts $1-create-char
id aiMiniDramaMakeCharacter.UIButton.info
wait 2
texts $1-create-char-info
tap 210 150
wait 1
id aiMiniDramaMakeCharacter.UIButton.close
wait 2
tap 249 338
wait 2
id aiMiniDramaCharacterPreview.UIButton.more
wait 2
texts $1-enlarge-more
id aiMiniDramaCharacterPreview.UIButton.more
wait 1
id aiMiniDramaCharacterPreview.UIButton.close
wait 1
id aiMiniDramaChangeCharacters.UIButton.close
wait 2
texts $1-leave-picker-dialog
?tapif Leave
wait 2
# Merger Season (ライバルの共闘): storyboard and video length card; then the composer and its leave dialog
id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.history
wait 3
lbl 綴じられた秘密
wait 4
?id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.scrollToBottom
?lbl ic arrow down
wait 2
texts $1-merger-bottom
drag 210 300 210 750 400
texts $1-merger-storyboard
id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.newChat
wait 3
?id aiMiniDramaEntry.UIButton.createDrama
wait 3
texts $1-composer
?hidekb
id aiMiniDramaOutline.UIButton.back
wait 2
texts $1-leave-composer-dialog
?id alertController.UIButton.button
wait 2
# Back to the Launcher
?id aiMiniDramaEntry.UIButton.back
wait 2
shot $1-end
